sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-antirrhinum-majus-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-antirrhinum-majus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-antirrhinum-majus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Antirrhinum majus Turing ocellus wavelength at 259 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 85.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Two-species activator-inhibitor system on a periodic petal-epidermis patch. Rates f_u, f_v, g_u, g_v = 1.25, -1.50, 2.00, -1.75 per hour; D_u, D_v = 640, 4341 µm²/h. Trace -0.50, determinant 0.8125, Turing margin positive, equal-diffusion control σ_max = -0.25 h⁻¹. k_c = argmax σ(k) gives λ_c = 259.13 µm at 0 Ma (assigned 259.2 µm). A joint diffusivity sweep (×0.35 to ×4) recovers k with Pearson r = 0.9992 and RMSE 0.00114 µm⁻¹. The gallery field's 100 µm bar (111 px) measures a ring pitch of 77.8 µm; KS against the simulated ring gaps is 1.0 because the two pitches do not overlap. GIF is 800×600, 12 frames. Computer-vision similarity of the last frame to the gallery field is 83.6. Overall 85.3. The radial PSD still reads k about 7% low at unit scale (remediation R1). Overall 85.3/100 (faithfulness 84.1, reproducibility 88.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 80, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 84, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/antirrhinum_majus_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-antirrhinum-majus-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/gif, 3276935 B, 800×600 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 7ec4b0240db6d0c7bc707e1b06094421d59e6b3f85858e4a8f3daf5ebe4792bd (sha256 7ec4b0240db6d0c7bc707e1b06094421d59e6b3f85858e4a8f3daf5ebe4792bd), spec_fingerprint 9aa96d9174bbc264f2f19508483526998fd8a90a8bb5b00ee7c2a039134c8ca4. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 9aa96d9174bbc264f2f19508483526998fd8a90a8bb5b00ee7c2a039134c8ca4; artifact_sha256: 7ec4b0240db6d0c7bc707e1b06094421d59e6b3f85858e4a8f3daf5ebe4792bd; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/antirrhinum_majus_turing_wavelength_s0/antirrhinum_majus_sete_cc-by-sa.jpg=4d2cd99ca49de264..., datasets/antirrhinum_majus_turing_wavelength_s0/antirrhinum_majus_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=0918abca4751ad6b..., datasets/antirrhinum_majus_turing_wavelength_s0/antirrhinum_majus_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=f3e9bf78a4453bc1...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Shang et al. 2010: Venosa MYB places anthocyanin over veins. | Noda et al. 1994: MIXTA conical epidermal cells intensify petal colour. | Turing 1952: diffusion-driven instability and a critical wavenumber.; reconstructed_in_script: Integer diffusivities D_u=640, D_v=4341 chosen so argmax σ(k) is 259.13 µm. | Split-step cubic saturation and the rendered radial ocellus.; transfer_boundary: Vein-locked Venosa pigment is not shown here to be a Turing instability. | The gallery ring pitch (77.8 µm) is a property of that asset, not a published histological wavelength.; does_not_claim: That Antirrhinum uses these kinetic constants in vivo. | That 77.8 µm and 259.13 µm are the same measurement.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Radial PSD uses integer pixel bins and reads k about 7% low at unit diffusivity (measured λ ≈ 279 µm vs λ_c 259.13 µm). Re-bin in physical wavenumber and re-measure Pearson r and RMSE.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Single assessor. A second provider has not scored this script.'}",
            "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Annotate the kink in σ(k) at the edge of the unstable band so it is not mistaken for a numerical glitch.'}" ;
        pk:hasScore "0.853"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor, single-agent Pass 1)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> .
}

